00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:46.740
Cloud can now turn simple text into animated videos and working dashboards.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:52.400
AI helpers started taking real actions online this week, and sometimes they got those actions

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.080
very wrong.

